      "writtenOn": "2021-02-25T10:05:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Forked the hayato specific issue to b:181203590.\n\nHowever, my interpretation is that the port is not required to detect cc voltage change, so we should not rely on the sleep(25ms) or whatever interval here..?",
